	(text "POWER: +12V -> D1 -> +12V_F (op amps, ladder, U1 HT7550-1 -> +5V reference); -12V -> D2 -> -12V_F."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 40.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "00c15ab0-e17f-529a-ac89-9c58b24ac4a8")
	)
	(text "BIG MODULAR LADDER - S5 schematic: pure-analog 6HP transistor ladder filter (no MIDI, no MCU, no VCA). Circuit intent and numbers: docs/research.md"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "034f7121-8461-5f2e-903d-180e9d85b0cb")
	)
	(text "SUPPLY PINS + DECOUPLING"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 213.36 40.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "3b0d618e-d901-547f-8916-cdd66bd00aac")
	)
	(text "Signal nets are wired; supplies use power symbols. LB0..LB4 (ladder base bias) are joined by their net labels."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 21.59 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "45b3edaa-b0a4-5dea-b2ad-a70c8ec0348b")
	)
	(text "OUTPUT: U6 followers on the top nodes, U7A x10 difference amp (LAD_DIF = 0.05 x IN),\nU9A AC coupled x20.6 -> 1k -> OUT (IN x 1.03, in phase)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 243.84 132.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "4f4f536c-c416-5c17-b7c5-30657bfcde25")
	)
	(text "RES knob (on +5V) + RES CV -> U7B virtual ground (10 uA / V each) -> Q9: I_ABC = 6.16 x I_in.\nKnob full or +5 V CV = 0.31 mA (k ~ 7.7); negative sum: D8, Q9 off. R50 caps I_ABC at ~1.2 mA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 284.48 360.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "8b422f50-793b-50bb-b042-0154e8e17a58")
	)
	(text "CUTOFF + CV summer -> 1/40 divider -> expo (Q3A reference at 0.55 mA, Q3B = ladder tail).\nD6 clamps V_S at -0.6 V (~31 kHz)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 294.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "8b77fe33-bc7d-5ed7-a35c-f3d5ba15dc6f")
	)
	(text "CV x DEPTH: J3 -> R9 -> DEPTH pot (0.56 x CV at full) -> U4A -> CV_S -> R14: 5 V = +8.3 octaves.\nCV LEDs anti-parallel in the U4A loop: D11 lights for a positive CV, D12 for a negative one,\nI_LED = |V(CV_S)| x (1 / R14 + closed steps), linear from 0 V.\nBrightness at 5 V CV / DEPTH full: JP1..JP3 open 0.06 mA; JP1 0.12; JP2 0.19; JP1+2 0.25;\nJP3 0.34; JP1+3 0.40; JP2+3 0.47; all 0.53 mA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 182.88 381 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "935f1504-7cba-5693-8074-eea2b7d88ea7")
	)
	(text "RESONANCE: U9B x -1.42 (LAD_DIF - 0.05 x IN) -> C20 -> 1/11 -> OTA U8A -> C22 -> feedback base (1k):\nk = 25 x I_ABC [mA], self-oscillation (k = 4) at ~0.17 mA; dry level kept at any k = the 16bit\n(1 + k) makeup."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 243.84 228.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "9a9d430f-75d9-5219-b2f5-f24a71dd7bd7")
	)
	(text "AUDIO IN: U5B x -1. LADDER: 200k / 1k into the driver (+/-25 mV); 4 rungs, 47n NP0;\nbias chain LB0..LB4 1.5 V steps."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 279.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "b9991faf-a7a2-5645-b531-e8ccd4ab6e22")
	)
	(text "Unused LM13700 half (inputs to GND, bias open = off) and buffers."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 416.56 238.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
